# Furniture and decor of the Alguacil's quarters

ent-BedCerberon = cerberon bed
    .desc = A sturdy fortified bed adorned with the Cerberon emblem of the fortress guard.

ent-FortressFireplace = fortress fireplace
    .desc = A massive stone fireplace with a crackling warm hearth.

ent-FortressMirror = wall mirror
    .desc = An antique ornate wall-mounted mirror.

ent-FortressCarpet = fortress carpet
    .desc = A rich, heavy red carpet with fortress trim.

ent-FortressCarpetPart = carpet edge
    .desc = Edge border of a fortress carpet.

ent-AlguacilDesk = alguacil desk
    .desc = A heavy, austere oak desk used for writing warrants and reviewing interrogation reports.

ent-AlguacilForensicTerminal = forensic terminal
    .desc = A specialized custody station terminal for logging fingerprints, ballistic reports, and criminal records.

ent-AlguacilChestDrawer = secret weapon drawer
    .desc = A discreet wooden chest drawer reinforced with dark iron brackets, containing a concealed weapon compartment.

ent-AlguacilChestDrawerFilled = secret weapon drawer (stocked)
    .desc = A discreet wooden chest drawer reinforced with dark iron brackets, containing a concealed weapon compartment.

# Weapons and ammunition

ent-WeaponGladius = combat gladius
    .desc = A balanced Roman-pattern infantry shortsword with a razor-sharp single edge and reinforced tip for thrusting.

ent-GladiusSheath = gladius sheath
    .desc = A rugged leather and bronze-trimmed sheath built to secure a gladius shortsword on the waist or back.

ent-GladiusSheathFilled = gladius in sheath
    .desc = A rugged leather and bronze-trimmed sheath with a gladius shortsword slotted inside.

ent-WeaponPistolMagnum66 = Magnum 66 pistol
    .desc = A devastating high-caliber semi-automatic service pistol favored by Alguacils. Feeds from .357 Magnum magazines.

ent-MagazineMagnum66 = pistol magazine (.357 Magnum)
    .desc = An 8-round single-stack steel magazine for the Magnum 66 pistol.

ent-MagazineMagnum66Empty = pistol magazine (.357 Magnum empty)
    .desc = An empty single-stack steel magazine for the Magnum 66 pistol.

ent-MagazineBoxMagnum357 = ammunition box (.357 Magnum)
    .desc = A rugged heavy cardboard box packed with 14 rounds of hard-hitting .357 Magnum cartridges.

ent-AlguacilCandle = tallow candle
    .desc = A thick, hand-dipped tallow candle that illuminates with a warm, steady glow.

ent-AlguacilCandleLit = lit tallow candle
    .desc = A thick, hand-dipped tallow candle glowing with a warm, steady flame.

ent-AlguacilLocker = cerberon security locker
    .desc = A reinforced iron security locker bearing the emblem of Cerberon, used to store arms and armor.

ent-AlguacilLockerFilled = cerberon security locker (stocked)
    .desc = A reinforced iron security locker bearing the emblem of Cerberon, stocked with weapons and armor.

ent-AlguacilWardrobe = alguacil wardrobe
    .desc = A grand antique wooden wardrobe with double doors, holding high-ranking custody vestments.
